{
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "<redacted>"
}

The address is reserved documentation data and is not associated with an actual customer.

During the deployment review, the agent extracted this configuration from the notification worker:

const MAIL_SETTINGS = {
  sender: "notifications@acme-platform.co.nz",
  recipient: process.env.SUPPORT_EMAIL,
  host: "smtp.internal"
};

The sender is a shared application mailbox used for automated delivery. The recipient is resolved from the deployment environment.
